<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 22/23.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 22/23.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Tuesday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for July 22/23. The kroon is pegged</p>
<p>at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	   July 22/23	July 21/22</p>
<p>    CZK    0.41819	    0.41709</p>
<p>    DKK    2.10093	    2.09983</p>
<p>    FIM    2.71177	    2.70773</p>
<p>    GBP   24.1696	    24.03405</p>
<p>    HUF    0.0747	     0.07453</p>
<p>    LTL    3.6115	     3.583</p>
<p>    LVL   25.09947	   24.9014</p>
<p>    RUR    0.0025	     0.00248</p>
<p>    SEK    1.85062	    1.84416</p>
<p>    UAH    7.78005	    7.71866</p>
<p>    USD   14.446	     14.332</p>
<p>    XEU   15.81765	   15.78168</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
